.th PXREF I 4/1/77
.sh NAME
pxref \*- Pascal cross-reference program
.sh SYNOPSIS
.bd pxref
file
.sh DESCRIPTION
This is the UNIX implementation of Wirth's cross reference program.
It makes a cross reference of the Pascal program argument on the
standard output.
.sh "SEE ALSO"
UNIX Pascal ``User Manual,'' ``Report Appendix,'' and ``PXP User Manual,''
pc (I),
pcx (I),
pxp (I),
pcc (I)
.sh AUTHOR
Niklaus Wirth
.sh BUGS
Cross reference is not block structured.
.s3
Identifiers are trimmed to 10 characters.
.s3
As Pascal is interpreted, this program is rather slow.
.s3
This program doesn't know that \fIassert\fR, \fIoct\fR, and \fIhex\fR
are keywords.
